{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15219080","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15219080","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1521907001:":{"text":"부탁이니까 한 번만 더...","source_cn":"求你们再去找找……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE6FFBA4A8E98984","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1521907002:":{"text":"안 된다니까요! 꿈도 꾸지 마세요!","source_cn":"不可能！别想了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D0768E9121F03EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521908001:0":{"text":"그만 좀 하세요! 저한테 물어본다고 뭐가 달라져요?!","source_cn":"别再问我了！问那么多有什么用？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF3659DDA4F5118C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521908002:0":{"text":"낸시르 씨도 잘 알잖아요? 그렇게나 심한 홍수에 휩쓸려 간 사람이 아직도 살아있을 리가 없잖아요! 그게 어린애라면 더 말할 것도 없죠!","source_cn":"你心里难道不清楚吗？洪灾那么严重，被洪水卷走的人根本没...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E80467E1D9E0B8B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521908003:1":{"text":"현실을 못 받아들이시면 저한테 백 번이 아니라 천 번을 물어보셔도 소용없어요!","source_cn":"你自己接受不了现实，就算一天问我上百遍也没用！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A9E1A7CAA405B37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male